#!/usr/bin/env goal
fn:?[2>#ARGS;"input.txt";ARGS 1]
\d:" "\'=-read fn
\l:0 1_´-1_'d
\(x;y):*l
\t:"#"=""\-1_1_*x  / target lights
w:#t / width of lights
\b:{@[w#0;x;:;1]}',/'"v"$'y / buttons
\n:#b / num buttons
\c:!n#2 / all combinations

/ 2!+/'+1 0 1 0 1 0 * b -> gives a variant. Must do this for all in c, find those matching the target, and then which one has fewest buttonpresses

